{
  "an10.45:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 10.45 ",
  "an10.45:0.2": "5. Abuse ",
  "an10.45:0.3": "Entering a Royal Compound ",
  "an10.45:1.1": "“Mendicants, there are ten drawbacks to entering a royal compound. ",
  "an10.45:1.2": "What ten? ",
  "an10.45:1.3": "Firstly, a king is sitting with his chief queen ",
  "an10.45:1.4": "when a monk enters. ",
  "an10.45:1.5": "When the queen sees the monk she smiles, or when the monk sees the queen he smiles. ",
  "an10.45:1.6": "So the king thinks: ",
  "an10.45:1.7": "‘They’ve done it for sure, or they will do it.’ ",
  "an10.45:1.8": "This is the first drawback of entering a royal compound. ",
  "an10.45:2.1": "Furthermore, a king has many duties, and much to do. He has sex with one of the women but doesn’t remember. ",
  "an10.45:2.2": "She gets pregnant from that. ",
  "an10.45:2.3": "So the king thinks: ",
  "an10.45:2.4": "‘No-one else has entered here, except that monk. ",
  "an10.45:2.5": "Could this be the monk’s doing?’ ",
  "an10.45:2.6": "This is the second drawback of entering a royal compound. ",
  "an10.45:3.1": "Furthermore, a gem is lost somewhere in the royal compound. ",
  "an10.45:3.2": "So the king thinks: ",
  "an10.45:3.3": "‘No-one else has entered here, except that monk. ",
  "an10.45:3.4": "Could this be the monk’s doing?’ ",
  "an10.45:3.5": "This is the third drawback of entering a royal compound. ",
  "an10.45:4.1": "Furthermore, secret deliberations in the royal compound are leaked outside. ",
  "an10.45:4.2": "So t